<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37707" root="لزب" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزُبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُزُوبٌ</span>, <i>It was,</i> or <i>remained, fixed, settled, firm,</i> or <i>constant.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَ</span>, aor. and inf. n. as above, <i>It</i> (mud &amp;c., S)
<i>adhered, clave,</i> or <i>stuck.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزُبَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزُبَ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزْبٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُزُوبٌ</span>, [<i>It became commixed,</i> or
<i>commingled: it intermixed;</i> or <i>it became contracted;</i>] <i>one part of it entered into another.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزُبَ</span> <i>It</i> (mud) <i>cohered, and
became hard.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَ</span>, aor. and inf. n. as
at first, <i>It was a time of drought, of no rain.</i>
(K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَتْهُ العَقْرَبُ</span> i. q. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَتْهُ</span>; <i>The scorpion
stung him.</i> (Kr, K.)

